<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>EcoEntulho</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
}

body{
    min-height:100vh;
    overflow-x:hidden;
}

.hero{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    padding:60px 8%;

    background:
    linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        rgba(2,18,43,.96) 0%,
        rgba(2,18,43,.92) 35%,
        rgba(2,18,43,.75) 60%,
        rgba(2,18,43,.40) 100%
    ),
    url("img/background-ecoentulho.png");

    background-size:cover;
    background-position:center;
    background-repeat:no-repeat;
}

.conteudo{
    max-width:800px;
}

.logo{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:18px;
    margin-bottom:40px;
}

.logo h1{
    font-size:4rem;
    color:white;
    font-weight:700;
}

.logo span{
    color:#63d471;
}

.conteudo h2{
    font-size:4.2rem;
    line-height:1.1;
    color:white;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.conteudo h2 strong{
    color:#63d471;
}

.descricao{
    font-size:1.25rem;
    color:#e6e6e6;
    max-width:650px;
    line-height:1.8;
    margin-bottom:50px;
}

.botao-container{
    width:100vw;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    margin-top:40px;
    margin-left:calc(-8vw);
}
.btn{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;

    min-width:360px;

    padding:26px 80px;

    border-radius:18px;

    background:linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        #63d471,
        #7ed957
    );

    color:#06152d;
    text-decoration:none;

    font-size:1.4rem;
    font-weight:700;

    box-shadow:0 15px 35px rgba(99,212,113,.4);

    transition:.3s;
}

.btn:hover{
    transform:translateY(-5px);
}

footer{
    position:fixed;
    bottom:20px;
    left:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    color:#d9d9d9;
    font-size:.95rem;
}

@media(max-width:768px){

    .logo h1{
        font-size:2.5rem;
    }

    .conteudo h2{
        font-size:2.5rem;
    }

    .descricao{
        font-size:1rem;
    }

    .btn{
        min-width:280px;
        padding:22px 40px;
        font-size:1.2rem;
    }

    footer{
        position:relative;
        left:auto;
        bottom:auto;
        transform:none;
        text-align:center;
        margin-top:30px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<section class="hero">

<div class="conteudo">

<div class="logo">

<svg width="95" height="95" viewBox="0 0 120 120">

<path d="M35 18 C15 18 8 38 22 50 C34 42 42 30 35 18" fill="#63d471"/>

<path d="M85 102 C105 102 112 82 98 70 C86 78 78 90 85 102" fill="#63d471"/>

<path d="M25 30 C5 55 10 90 40 105"
fill="none"
stroke="#63d471"
stroke-width="7"
stroke-linecap="round"/>

<path d="M95 90 C115 65 110 30 80 15"
fill="none"
stroke="#63d471"
stroke-width="7"
stroke-linecap="round"/>

<rect x="45" y="28" width="24" height="48" rx="2" fill="white"/>

<rect x="70" y="42" width="14" height="34" rx="2" fill="white"/>

<rect x="50" y="35" width="4" height="4" fill="#0b2447"/>
<rect x="60" y="35" width="4" height="4" fill="#0b2447"/>
<rect x="50" y="45" width="4" height="4" fill="#0b2447"/>
<rect x="60" y="45" width="4" height="4" fill="#0b2447"/>
<rect x="50" y="55" width="4" height="4" fill="#0b2447"/>
<rect x="60" y="55" width="4" height="4" fill="#0b2447"/>

</svg>

<h1><span>Eco</span>Entulho</h1>

</div>

<h2>
Gestão Inteligente de
<strong>Resíduos da Construção Civil</strong>
</h2>

<p class="descricao">
Controle sustentável de resíduos para construtoras.
</p>

<div class="botao-container">
<a href="login.html" class="btn">
🔐 Entrar no Sistema
</a>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<footer>
EcoEntulho • Projeto de Extensão Universitária • 2026
</footer>

</body>
</html>
